        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Reinungh himdai lu zipchung khou,",
            "Baanch’ra nun suan guang e,",
            "Kaniu kachaek nrah gei na",
            "Kauh Guang cham phung guang e,",
            "“Dih khou chuzaengmei nai kandiu,",
            "Kalung kunloumei khou”",
            "Kandimei guai rui rim-rim bam,",
            "Baanch’ra nun lu king khang,",
            "",
            "2. Chuzaengmei sukaeng kalaaphna,",
            "Tingpuk samkaan kei e,",
            "Tingkau lukhuan kagaeng guang e",
            "Lakmei kandi rukhou;",
            "Kaniu sukaeng tei laampatlou",
            "Rianra nzaeng rukhou,",
            "Pap kandi simei khuan rukhou,",
            "Baanch’ra guai lusuan bam.",
            "",
            "3. Nangniu, panti rianra bang khou,",
            "Puatrit phung bammei guai,",
            "Rianramei phaikaam nzaengna",
            "Tatku bammei nun thiu",
            "Gai liangmei gan ntau guang the;",
            "Zaulana guangkhap tho!",
            "Rianra chaengdaeng khou nthaekna,",
            "Baanch’ra nun lu king o."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
